<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB to upgrade China power plant.</title>
<headline>ABB to upgrade China power plant.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical engineering group ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG said it had received a $60 million order to modernize a coal-fired heat and power plant in Beijing.</p>
<p>The retrofit contract was aimed at helping 39-year-old cogeneration plant Beijing Number 1 meet steadily increasing local energy demand, ABB said in a statement.</p>
</text>
